  "_design_note": "The hub, rebuilt as a four-level hall for the full-size character. Floor surface row 21; a solid dais at row 18 (+48px) the player walks over rather than under; ledge 2 at row 14 (+64px above the dais) is the highest surface reachable without a relic. The gate ledge at row 6 sits 128px above ledge 2 \u2014 beyond the 101px single jump, inside the 181px double jump \u2014 so it is the Twin Step gate, and it runs east to the upper_east door. Rows 8-13 are kept free of every standable tile so the climb cannot be chained. See design/levels/room-graph.md.",
